29
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:21,520
I'm listening. I got it.

30
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:28,200
It's seven days earlier.

31
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,469
Okay.

32
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:32,280
Let's

33
