85
00:04:31,345 --> 00:04:32,640
Director Li, well...

86
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:35,040
Director Li has made
such a big decision.

87
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:37,939
Dr. Liu, just please fulfill his wish.

88
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:40,960
He will sign all the documents.

89
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,567
Right,

90
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:45,160
