101
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:14,440
Xiaotang, Xiaotang, let's talk again.

102
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:16,040
Xiaotang.

103
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,429
Xiaotang.

104
00:05:32,960 --> 00:05:33,960
Director Li,

105
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:37,458
