115
00:05:57,800 --> 00:06:00,040
We used the latest generation
of protein threads

116
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,480
and implanted over 200 threads

117
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:03,960
in the deep layers of your skin

118
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:05,680
to ensure the lifting effect

119
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:07,920
