120
00:06:08,080 --> 00:06:09,649
Phase three,

121
00:06:09,649 --> 00:06:12,360
we extracted high-quality fat
from your inner thighs

122
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:14,212
to fill your forehead,

123
00:06:14,212 --> 00:06:15,420
temples,

124
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:17,040
nasolabial folds, and chin.

125
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:19,440
We also did abdominoplasty

126
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:23,000
and male chest contouring.

127
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:29,000
Dr. Liu, slow down.

128
00:06:29,520 --> 00:06:31,760
Director Li just made
such a big sacrifice.

129
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,560
I'm afraid he can't deal with it.

130
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,149
Director Li,

131
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:36,357
