133
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:41,240
Doesn't it look like a great hero?

134
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:42,844
Get lost!

135
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,360
All of you, get lost!

136
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:46,360
Gu Xiaotang,

137
00:06:47,322 --> 00:06:49,000
I won't let you off.

138
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:52,400
Director Li, you just had surgery.

139
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:53,600
