160
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:53,040
- Yes.
- Yes.

161
00:08:05,760 --> 00:08:08,560
Mei, you seem
to care a lot about Xiaotang.

162
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:10,600
Every time I want to deal with her,

163
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:12,480
