164
00:08:13,080 --> 00:08:14,115
Right?

165
00:08:14,222 --> 00:08:15,560
D-Director,

166
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:16,760
I-I didn't.

167
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,200
You didn't?

168
00:08:19,200 --> 00:08:20,800
You think I really don't know?

169
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:23,360
Your mother's sickness

170
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:25,059
