and her mother.

191
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:20,840
(Counterattack Lu Qingyuan and Xia Na)
And Xia Na.

192
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:24,040
I must take control of the initiative

193
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:25,800
