198
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:50,997
Xiaotang. Xiaotang, it's me.

199
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:53,017
Mei?

200
00:09:53,280 --> 00:09:54,396
Mei, wait a moment.

201
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,840
What's wrong, Mei?

202
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:04,303
Who are you?

203
00:10:05,490 --> 00:10:06,537
Let me go!

204
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:08,076
Let me go!

205
00:10:46,583 --> 00:10:49,939
♪The face deep in the heart♪

206
00:10:50,131 --> 00:10:52,593
